  Spanish. Vietnamese proper nouns keep their diacritics — Việt Nam, Hoàng Sa — because the
  traveller has to match what they read here against a sign, a ticket and a map that are
  written only that way. Apostrophes are written directly, never escaped: Compose
  Multiplatform does not unescape them. See values/strings.xml for the rest.
-->
